{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YGkjiGt1oC9ZBgJyJ5hxLA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:23.365907+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YGkjiGt1oC9ZBgJyJ5hxLA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>重庆大学是中央直管、教育部直属的全国重点大学，是国家“双一流”A类、“985工程”、“211工程”重点建设高校。重庆大学智能汽车技术学院（以下简称“智能汽车学院”）为学校直属实体二级学院。为推进教育科技人才一体发展，2025年7月，在重庆市人民政府的指导下，重庆大学与引望智能技术有限公司三方共建正式成立智能汽车技术学院，探索“产业导向、双导师制、专业交叉、项目驱动”的智能汽车方向复合型人才培养新范式，深化课程体系重构与学科交叉融合，全力打造具有国际影响力的智能汽车产业卓越工程人才培养高地、核心技术创新高地和未来产业孵化高地。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75Hhcia7nOv3hmOKehvWvKCEEee4SEWxYVhdvUicEiaIXya5icMfueGfjGREgnncDPJBiaBY7FOI5DngLfxshYXo5eW9frSiaBpCe171jE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HhxCZCVbjjNaC3DygbmBlayaoGT1BAZULSNPCDRaCOJXxib5awUewVjwxNog7ZC8TPXmr4BSZC1SXanI0RDJRcldSMpUZEwTcG8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HgawgAnFWwu3bTXzPf4oGoAFprEeQRicoibqtfnjfpWiaCdA4jsUnQuGR7OwVrwfL4GjxwRxMFntxLVG9hfbnO6z44r4sevdD9FOI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HheKmW2sTiaycOGtN9q15RpsWfYib4aiaaegEKibT0g4dcDwCssTZ26bq2WicSS2wvlmGurjlrgNibgibrnFUsjS7YHFA2ibeXEbCOkZwA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75Hia4EYcOb1zichSkzS7UFN0joxcR04cD6fRRyCwEgra7zzePRWCt1U9veuiacRq0k5b5lovZetRMvNaibs1dQiaWkR3QBtGyEkTzBRA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院创新构建“1.5+X”真问题牵引产教融合有组织人才培养新模式，前1.5学年聚焦核心课程学习，通过校内实验室实训与入企实践相结合的工学交替模式，完成第一阶段高阶产业技术课题研究；剩余X学年将依据校企联合考核结果实施分流培养，学生可灵活选择继续留企深化实践，或返回校内实验室开展挑战性产业项目攻关，同步推进学位论文撰写与成果转化，形成“学习-实践-研究-转化”的培养质量闭环。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75Hg2VJib1q0Jmlek4icZE1sqhJpoMch56nEJmqLhw8r2srH1HQVP9qxjYFjmQOSib7qVfa53I84iaJaB5hfvtmL6hU50juntfibdXByg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75Hh8zDjibyrVLYZ62AgwXjtc4noHDQX3szlnfh7mMBRdM7kmqRvHfVKiavyadJdetSicGiblxLycSdB3ia30Qvyyz9ia4FWmHC8vHOtAA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75Hiacp61icgUomuQnMqOOpyQCwAhcDupgbTUtXM0RmnL8KNZzfJQmwXaNVgjlXd940f3gR8WCp4z4bTC48LsPt3dlCTpzaaOHVWibE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HjibwpR5uic4mpPkoeic9ibLC16ZiarnuSGqIzicCYbdKJJf4S65tJbuytP8RGHFVuWbucuhW2LA16SxTolA0Qm1yiaTCpic8P4T4Nq0jI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HjomaJfrDtCnSJWyZicEHJDbGnOGFIUDbMOXovkHGwSImDgCjHr8uugY6gJwQ3WN7FkwFjicHwx3QicbMABIeufznHNsvreHhPMm0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院风采</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>根据《重庆大学2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生预报名公告》，现启动我院2027年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名工作，具体如下：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业与类型</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/t4Uas8g75Hh7QTRhooq7SiaagBxpvJ3gic32Zgk51K8atPJQjgDWLfqKs2RcB2qS6ZVxXcGWPsw4F7s0kkafRyI2vbfxxqQvpJw8ephdSLk60/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名基本条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的2027届优秀本科生，手续完备，材料齐全。</span></p><p><span>2.在校期间政治思想表现好，品德优良，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，勤奋好学，遵纪守法，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违纪违法受处分处罚记录。</span></p><p><span>3.思维敏捷，动手能力强，创新意识突出，具备较强的工程实践能力、科研探索能力和综合问题分析解决能力，对工程技术研发、产业创新应用有浓厚兴趣。</span></p><p><span>4.符合我校当年招生章程和招生专业目录中规定的报考条件。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>凡符合上述报名条件，且有意愿报考我院的推免生（含直博生），请登录“重庆大学研究生招生服务系统”（网址：http：//syk.cqu.edu.cn）准确填写各项个人信息、报名院系专业及层次、提交相关申请材料。</span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.报名时间：即日起至2026年9月18日24：00。</span></p><p><span>2.提交材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）个人简历（无模板）；</span></p><p><span>（2）大学本科阶段成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>（3）外语水平证明（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）科研创新证明、重要奖项证书等（校级及以上获奖证书，公开发表的学术论文、专利，以及参与科研项目、竞赛等证明自身能力的材料）；</span></p><p><span><span>注意事项：将上述材料按照以上顺序扫描合成一份PDF上传报名系统。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>04</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免考核</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.材料审核：</span></p><p><span>智能汽车学院将根据报名情况审核个人信息和申请材料，并通过系统进行反馈。学生在提交报名申请后，请随时关注系统查询材料审核进度。</span></p><p><span>2.推免考核安排：</span></p><p><span>复试时间及其他具体安排将在后续推免考核实施细则中通知，请关注“重庆大学研究生招生信息网”，以及留意报名系统信息。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>05</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免拟录取</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.材料审核：</span></p><p><span>智能汽车学院将根据报名情况审核个人信息和申请材料，并通过系统进行反馈。学生在提交报名申请后，请随时关注系统查询材料审核进度。</span></p><p><span>2.推免考核安排：</span></p><p><span>复试时间及其他具体安排将在后续推免考核实施细则中通知，请关注“重庆大学研究生招生信息网”，以及留意报名系统信息。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>06</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.对于提供虚假报考信息或不符合报考条件的考生，一经查实，即取消录取资格、入学资格或学籍，直至撤销学历及学位，且责任由考生本人承担。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.如国家出台新的研究生招生政策，我院将做相应调整并及时公布。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本公告解释权归智能汽车技术学院所有。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>07</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖励政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>按照国家政策，向推免研究生提供以下奖、助学金：</span></p><p><span>1.入学第一年可优先获得学校A等学业奖学金参评资格；在读期间可享受学校研究生助学金，具体以学校实施办法为准。</span></p><p><span>2.直博生以及强基计划本研转段为博士研究生可以获得推免研究生奖学金。</span></p><p><span>3.在读期间可优先获得学校研究生创新计划项目等研究生科研资助项目支持。</span></p><p><span>4.现有奖助政策如有调整，或新增其他奖助学金政策将另行通知。</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>      5.除上述奖助学金政策外，智能汽车学院还有学院另设的智能汽车研究生新生奖学金(全覆盖）及卓越奖学金，相关规定详见学院奖学金管理文件。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>08</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.QQ交流群</span></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎加入“智能汽车学院2027年预推免交流群”（QQ群号：1108752572）咨询，申请入群请备注“姓名+本科学校”，申请报名的同学请务必加入此QQ群，进一步通知将在QQ群内发布，也可在群内交流咨询。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HhbVlmRegJfpsQAXIRQ43lNcoibxK1MZ3AdFfrgy8uD3qNQbU0SBhcFN5okDicQfvfPlseGlDVhzGJc5FI2gjSVSS2jNTLSiabyOA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>2.咨询电话:023-65675022</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>-END-</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/t4Uas8g75HjPKLwh6ymRBfts1W8dgBzbZbGWsuJ0Xp7BiaMjWFYyvZSEs8521SqEw2meiatn76UK1B93A7THE54r5OPfnGhcreGxtGvHjia4cQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>图片</span></strong></span><span>丨智能汽车技术学院</span></p><p><span><strong><span>文字</span></strong></span><span>丨赵冰清</span></p><p><span><strong><span>编辑</span></strong></span><span>丨赵冰清</span></p><p><font><strong><span>审核</span></strong></font><span>丨陈宏英、陈咸彰、宋朝省</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"971e653ef23f81621b9291565b8b9d13d8b91a48e105b58b879b144d25e0cb95","textLength":1896,"sourceSha256":"a0ee2106a3c7c5c08685661665bd419b57257beef112588faf71d9d4141fedb7","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-752aa7dece0c8c128e0e","title":"2026年重庆大学智能汽车技术学院2027年推免研究生招生预报名公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:23.365907+00:00"}
